{"text": "Police Inspector Ochumelov was walking across the market square in a new overcoat, carrying a small bundle under his arm. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Behind him walked a red haired policeman named Yeldyrin, holding a sieve full of gooseberries taken away from someone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All around them was silence, and there was not a single person in the square. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The open doors of the shops and taverns looked out on the world sadly, like hungry mouths. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly Ochumelov heard a man shouting, So you bite, do you, you terrible beast, Do not let it go, lads. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A small dog came running out of Pichugins woodyard on three legs, whining loudly as it ran. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A man in a starched shirt chased after it, and throwing himself forward, he fell to the ground and grabbed its back legs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sleepy faces looked out from the shops, and soon a crowd gathered around the woodyard, as if it had sprung out of the ground. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It looks like a disturbance, sir, said the policeman, and Ochumelov turned and marched toward the crowd. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At the gate stood the man, holding up his bleeding finger, which looked like a flag of victory.", "alignment": {"characters": ["P", "o", "l", "i", "c", "e", " ", "I", "n", "s", "p", "e", "c", "t", "o", "r", " ", "O", "c", "h", "u", "m", "e", "l", "o", "v", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "w", "a", "l", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", "c", "r", "o", "s", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "a", "r", "k", "e", "t", " ", "s", "q", "u", "a", "r", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "n", "e", "w", " ", "o", "v", "e", "r", "c", "o", "a", "t", ",", " ", "c", "a", "r", "r", "y", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", " ", "b", "u", "n", "d", "l", "e", " ", "u", "n", "d", "e", "r", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "a", "r", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", 